 	specific plugin initialization for Windows
	(PlatformDestroy): [new func] performs platform specific plugin
 	cleanup for Unix
	(PlatformEventLoop): [new func] installs a Windows event loop to
 	catch events that aren't filtered through automatically to the
 	TerraVision child window.
	(PluginWindowProc): [new func] a Windows event loop that
 	essentially catches repaint events and sends them on to
 	TerraVision

